translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_b08547c7:

    # "She stopped crying and the ground began to shake violently..."
    "Elle cessa de pleurer et le sol se mit à trembler violemment..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:840
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e64ba56e:

    # "Her lifeless eyes rolled white as a huge, monstrous... thing dragged itself from inside of her."
    "Ses yeux sans vie roulèrent blancs tandis qu'une énorme... chose monstrueuse se hissait hors d'elle."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:841
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_4b513b50:

    # "Scorpion like in appearance, with tentacles piercing its way through her orifices, it made the {i}dead{/i} woman scream."
    "D'apparence scorpionne, avec des tentacules se frayant un chemin à travers ses orifices, cela fit crier la femme {i}morte{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:843
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_556e580b:

    # "The beast was a colossus, tearing down what remained of the house it had hidden under it rose onto its six legs."
    "La bête était un colosse, démolissant ce qui restait de la maison sous laquelle elle s'était cachée en se dressant sur ses six pattes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:844
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_a4ab5169:

    # "It’s skin black and red, its eyes were glowing with malevolence, as it slavered in anticipation."
    "Sa peau noire et rouge, ses yeux brillaient de malveillance, tandis qu'elle bavait d'anticipation."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:846
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_df99a23e:

    # KIARA "Get out of the way!"
    KIARA "Écartez-vous !"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:847
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_d2a55f19:

    # "Horrified, Borras froze in fear before he moved to grab his sword, but it was too late."
    "Horrifié, Borras se figea de peur avant de tenter d'attraper son épée, mais il était trop tard."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:853
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_15d262ef:

    # "A toxic acid spewed from the thing’s mouth, Borras tried to roll to dodge the blast but was quickly engulfed and left writhing in agony, animal like cries shuddering through him."
    "Un acide toxique jaillit de la gueule de la créature ; Borras essaya de rouler pour esquiver le jet, mais fut rapidement submergé et se mit à se tordre d'agonie, poussant des cris bestiaux qui le parcouraient de frissons."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:854
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_2d77f11e:

    # "Desperately, he clawed at his own melting face before becoming deathly quiet, limply turning to face us one with only the sizzling sounds of the acid still dissolving through his bones."
    "Désespérément, il griffa son propre visage en train de fondre avant de devenir mortellement silencieux, se tournant mollement vers nous, seul le grésillement de l'acide continuant à dissoudre ses os."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:856
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_f15fdca9:

    # "His eyes blinked in disbelief that he was about to die, with a trembling hand he tried to motion something with his sword."
    "Ses yeux clignèrent d'incrédulité à l'idée qu'il allait mourir ; d'une main tremblante, il tenta de faire un geste avec son épée."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:857
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_716bc802:

    # "There was nothing but horror etched onto what was left of his face before he collapsed, raising the sword up as if he was going to plunge it into himself."
    "Il n'y avait que de l'horreur gravée sur ce qui restait de son visage avant qu'il ne s'effondre, levant l'épée comme s'il allait se la planter dans le corps."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:858
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_ad1aafe6:

    # "Instead, he planted it in the ground allowing it to take the weight of what we witnessed become his corpse, perhaps in a position he deemed more dignified than lying at the feet of the Demorai that killed him."
    "Au lieu de cela, il la planta dans le sol, lui laissant supporter le poids de ce que nous vîmes devenir son cadavre, peut-être dans une posture qu'il jugeait plus digne que de gésir aux pieds du Démoraï qui l'avait tué."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:867
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_acc7c430:

    # DUPREY "ON ME!"
    DUPREY "SUR MOI !"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:881
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_1b3652e9:

    # "Exhausted and at our breaking point, we watched as the thing slumped over to its side, bloodied and taking staggered breaths."
    "Épuisés et à bout de forces, nous regardâmes la chose s'affaler sur le flanc, ensanglantée et haletante."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:882
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_a13bee82:

    # "Captain Duprey stormed towards it as it squirmed in agony, trying to drag itself away."
    "Le capitaine Duprey se précipita vers elle qui se tordait d'agonie, tentant de se traîner au loin."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:883
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_87fa56d5:

    # "Swinging his axe down one last time onto the thing’s head, in one clean cut Duprey eviscerated its skull and pierced through to its brain."
    "Abattant sa hache une dernière fois sur la tête de la créature, d'un coup net, Duprey lui fendit le crâne et transperça son cerveau."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:887
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_3fc9c07e:

    # "We all looked around in horror as we waited for what was to happen next, slowly the Captain turned to look at us with lifeless eyes."
    "Nous avons tous regardé autour de nous avec horreur en attendant ce qui allait se passer ensuite, lentement le Capitaine se tourna pour nous regarder avec des yeux sans vie."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:889
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_7f8a03ed:

    # MARKUS "... C-Captain... It... It just...."
    MARKUS "... C-Capitaine... C'est... C'est juste..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:890
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_8098a9e5:

    # DUPREY "... We’re nearly there. Come on...."
    DUPREY "... Nous y sommes presque. Allez...."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:891
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_118a43a1:

    # MARKUS "But we—"
    MARKUS "Mais nous—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:892
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_4e07c4e9:

    # DUPREY "{i}Come. On.{/i}"
    DUPREY "{i}Allez. Viens.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:893
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_fdb0e643:

    # "As Markus stared at Borras’ corpse, frozen in horror, the Captain put his hand almost tenderly on his shoulder."
    "Alors que Markus fixait le cadavre de Borras, figé d'horreur, le Capitaine posa sa main presque tendrement sur son épaule."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:894
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_b72d9ec2:

    # DUPREY "We keep moving, you understand?"
    DUPREY "On continue d'avancer, tu comprends ?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:895
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_42029655:

    # "Markus nodded weakly."
    "Markus hocha faiblement la tête."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:897
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_acfa9909:

    # "Staggering towards his horse, the Captain clambered onto it and began to trot on ahead."
    "En titubant vers son cheval, le Capitaine y grimpa et commença à trotter devant."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:900
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e8141954:

    # "The men, horrified at what they had just witnessed, once again fell into place behind him."
    "Les hommes, horrifiés par ce qu'ils venaient de voir, se remirent en place derrière lui une fois de plus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:901
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_fd3fd31f:

    # "By now, any optimism we had felt since our first small battle on the ridge was really and truly gone."
    "Désormais, tout l'optimisme que nous avions ressenti depuis notre première petite bataille sur la crête avait vraiment et totalement disparu."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:902
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_f3c22127:

    # "We had all been brutally reminded that out here, we were not the hunters, but the {i}hunted{/i}."
    "Nous avions tous été brutalement rappelés qu'ici, nous n'étions pas les chasseurs, mais les {i}proies{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:912
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c21cf7c5:

    # "More than a week passed since Borras’ death."
    "Plus d'une semaine s'était écoulée depuis la mort de Borras."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:913
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_7cd181f4:

    # "Days and days of travelling on mercilessly, Duprey pushing us harder and harder, fuelled by the death of his friend."
    "Des jours et des jours de voyage incessant, Duprey nous poussant de plus en plus dur, alimenté par la mort de son ami."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:914
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_48ad92c6:

    # "We found ourselves marching through the thick, seemingly endless forest, every snap of a twig set us on edge as we looked out for enemies that might be lurking."
    "Nous nous retrouvions à marcher à travers la forêt dense et apparemment sans fin, chaque craquement de branche nous mettait sur les nerfs tandis que nous guettions les ennemis qui pourraient être tapis."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:915
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_15d0ae3b:

    # "I’d never before felt so vulnerable whilst being surrounded by so many people."
    "Je ne m'étais jamais senti aussi vulnérable tout en étant entouré d'autant de personnes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:916
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e2d2b968:

    # "I marvelled over how we’d proceeded so long on this journey, carelessly allowing ourselves the hope that we might just be alright."
    "Je m'émerveillais de la façon dont nous avions poursuivi ce voyage si longtemps, nous permettant imprudemment l'espoir que tout irait bien."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:917
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_af5902e0:

    # "Now I found my heart was always racing."
    "À présent, je trouvais que mon cœur battait toujours la chamade."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:918
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_ef9db5b9:

    # "I allowed the fear to wash over me every morning, I depended on it to keep me on edge."
    "Je laissais la peur me submerger chaque matin, je comptais sur elle pour me maintenir sur mes gardes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:919
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_ed8f2bdd:

    # "Sleep was nightmare after nightmare, I made sure that whenever I did manage to steal a few hours of rest that my sword was always within arm’s reach."
    "Le sommeil n'était qu'une succession de cauchemars, je m'assurais que chaque fois que je parvenais à voler quelques heures de repos, mon épée était toujours à portée de main."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:920
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_093c96fb:

    # "Finally, just as the rain began to hammer down onto the ground and dark grey clouds circled overhead, we arrived at the fort."
    "Finalement, juste au moment où la pluie commençait à s'abattre sur le sol et que de sombres nuages gris tournoyaient au-dessus de nos têtes, nous sommes arrivés au fort."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:924
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_85b5b56a:

    # "As we trudged our way inside the mud-soaked fort through what was left of the gate, we looked around at the dismal lifelessness of the place."
    "Alors que nous nous traînions à l'intérieur du fort boueux par ce qui restait de la porte, nous avons regardé autour de nous la triste absence de vie de l'endroit."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:926
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_88fc8c4d:

    # "There was no sign of anyone and there hadn’t been for a while."
    "Il n'y avait aucun signe de qui que ce soit et cela faisait un moment que ce n'était plus le cas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:927
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_0aca1b04:

    # "Here and there were scattered the ruinous remains of the old buildings and overturned fruit carts."
    "Çà et là étaient éparpillés les restes en ruine des vieux bâtiments et des charrettes de fruits renversées."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:929
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c976be39:

    # "Perhaps most prominently, and propped up by the various wooden frames, was a colossal tunnel that had been dug into the mountain itself."
    "Peut-être le plus remarquable, et soutenu par diverses charpentes en bois, se trouvait un tunnel colossal qui avait été creusé dans la montagne elle-même."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:930
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_079427da:

    # "Inside it was pitch black, but it was clear from the burned-out torches at the entrance that whoever had inhabited this place had spent a considerable amount of time in these tunnels."
    "À l'intérieur, il faisait noir comme dans un four, mais il était clair, d'après les torches brûlées à l'entrée, que quiconque avait habité cet endroit avait passé un temps considérable dans ces tunnels."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:931
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_6cf2b373:

    # "Captain Duprey looked around and then turned to us cautiously."
    "Le capitaine Duprey regarda autour de lui puis se tourna vers nous avec prudence."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:936
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c7470f9d:

    # DUPREY "Right, on me, you lot."
    DUPREY "Bien, tous sur moi, vous autres."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:942
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_bd175ca6:

    # "With freshly lit torches, we followed Captain Duprey deeper into the tunnel."
    "Avec des torches fraîchement allumées, nous suivîmes le capitaine Duprey plus profondément dans le tunnel."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:943
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_3217bf80:

    # "It seemed to drag on endlessly, meandering up and down, delving deeper and deeper into the mountain."
    "Il semblait s'étirer sans fin, serpentant en montant et en descendant, s'enfonçant de plus en plus profondément dans la montagne."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:944
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e1df4315:

    # "We finally reached a formidable stone wall blocking our way, inscribed with strange markings I was not familiar with."
    "Nous avons finalement atteint un mur de pierre redoutable bloquant notre chemin, gravé de marques étranges que je ne connaissais pas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:945
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_94a75c24:

    # "As the Captain gently touched his hand on its cold wet surface, the inscribed markings began to glow an ominous red and he stepped back, more cautious than I’d ever seen him."
    "Alors que le Capitaine posait doucement sa main sur sa surface froide et humide, les marques gravées se mirent à luire d'un rouge menaçant, et il recula, plus prudent que je ne l'avais jamais vu."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:947
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e411519c:

    # DUPREY "Hmm..."
    DUPREY "Hmm..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:949
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e67c2c91:

    # "He looked back at the others and whistled."
    "Il regarda les autres et siffla."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:950
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_f242c681:

    # DUPREY "Get one of those mages down here now!"
    DUPREY "Faites venir un de ces mages ici immédiatement !"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:951
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_1ef1e65a:

    # DUPREY "I’ll bet any one of you a keg of rum that what we’re looking for is behind here."
    DUPREY "Je parie à n'importe lequel d'entre vous un tonnelet de rhum que ce que nous cherchons se trouve derrière ce mur."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:955
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_edba64a4:

    # "As a couple of the mages rushed forward, they frantically began to inspect the inscription, running their hands over it and muttering to themselves."
    "Alors que deux des mages se précipitaient en avant, ils commencèrent à inspecter frénétiquement l'inscription, passant leurs mains dessus et marmonnant pour eux-mêmes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:959
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c8092128:

    # MAGE "This may take us some time to open, Captain."
    MAGE "Cela pourrait nous prendre du temps pour l'ouvrir, Capitaine."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:960
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_a4f83352:

    # DUPREY "Hurry as quick as you can, I don’t like being caught in this forsaken place."
    DUPREY "Dépêchez-vous aussi vite que vous le pouvez, je n'aime pas être pris au piège dans cet endroit maudit."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:961
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_3142b6d0:

    # DUPREY "MEN! TAKE POSITIONS ON THE FORT! SECURE THE AREA!"
    DUPREY "HOMMES ! PRENEZ POSITION SUR LE FORT ! SÉCURISEZ LA ZONE !"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:965
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_3f5bdf35:

    # "We leapt to attention at his order and made our way out once again into the fort."
    "Nous nous sommes levés au garde-à-vous à son ordre et sommes ressortis dans le fort."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:966
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_cc451534:

    # MC "(Wonder what’s behind that thing?)"
    MC "(Je me demande ce qu'il y a derrière ce truc ?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:969
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_a8bb7d00:

    # "The men moved to take positions around the remnants of the fort."
    "Les hommes se sont mis en position autour des vestiges du fort."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:970
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_8aa761bc:

    # "Nervous, I went and asked for some supplies from the supply wagon."
    "Nerveux, je suis allé demander des provisions au chariot de ravitaillement."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:974
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_734778e3:

    # "There was an eerie silence as we waited and watched impatiently, each of us wondering what had happened here, most of us too scared to voice our ideas."
    "Il y avait un silence sinistre tandis que nous attendions et observions avec impatience, chacun se demandant ce qui s'était passé ici, la plupart trop effrayés pour exprimer leurs idées."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:975
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c03a767e:

    # "Painted on the face of every man and woman was the unease of the realisation that we were sitting ducks."
    "Sur le visage de chaque homme et femme se lisait le malaise de réaliser que nous étions des cibles faciles."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:976
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_da552107:

    # "We could do nothing more than pray that the seal would open and we could collect whatever was behind it quickly and leave this haunted place in our memories."
    "Nous ne pouvions rien faire d'autre que prier pour que le sceau s'ouvre, que nous puissions récupérer rapidement ce qui se trouvait derrière et laisser cet endroit hanté dans nos souvenirs."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:977
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_5092d10a:

    # "Restless, I was pacing from one watch spot to another."
    "Agité, je faisais les cent pas d'un poste de guet à l'autre."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:985
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_ed8e8a66:

    # "Markus, much like me, was nervously patrolling the fort grounds."
