# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1383
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_aeb74839:

    # "‘Consider this my final gift unto you, {i}my lord{/i}, I die safe in the knowledge that once you retrieve these things, you will finally turn the tide of this war...’"
    "‘Considérez ceci comme mon dernier cadeau pour vous, {i}mon seigneur{/i}, je meurs avec la certitude qu'une fois que vous aurez récupéré ces objets, vous finirez par changer le cours de cette guerre...’"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1384
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_56e8ecef:

    # "‘But be wary, their power is still highly unstable... Choose only the finest to wield them, for to choose any less would spell {i}disaster{/i} for the realm.’"
