    "En inspectant les tables couvertes de poussière chargées de potions, j'essayai de lire les dizaines d'étiquettes sur chaque bocal et fiole mais ne reconnus presque aucun des ingrédients."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1394
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPotions_03c042eb:

    # MC "What is all this for?"
    MC "À quoi tout cela sert-il ?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1396
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPotions_27c7f643:

    # "Markus glanced over the potions and picked one up:"
