    "...des visions de centaines de femmes nues de toutes les races différentes que je n'avais jamais vues..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1443
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_ac79c46e:

    # "...fawning over me desperately, moaning in intense pleasure as I sat on what seemed like a golden throne..."
    "...m'adulant désespérément, gémissant de plaisir intense alors que j'étais assis sur ce qui semblait être un trône d'or..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1444
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_15801940:

    # "...storm clouds gathering overhead as lightning forked to the world below..."
    "...des nuages d'orage s'amoncelant au-dessus alors que la foudre se ramifiait vers le monde en contrebas..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1459
translate fr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7ebda109:

